### `styles.css`

```css
/* ==============================
   SPORTS CENTRAL
   ============================== */

:root {
    --navy: #12355b;
    --dark-navy: #0b2545;
    --blue: #1d5fa7;
    --background: #f4f7fb;
    --white: #ffffff;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --border: #b8c4d1;
    --error: #a61b1b;

    /* 8px spacing system */
    --space-1: 8px;
    --space-2: 16px;
    --space-3: 24px;
    --space-4: 32px;
    --space-5: 40px;
    --space-6: 48px;
}


/* ==============================
   BASIC STYLING
   ============================== */

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}


html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}


body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;

    background-color: var(--background);
    color: var(--text);

    font-family: "Open Sans", sans-serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
}


h1,
h2,
h3 {
    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
    color: var(--dark-navy);
    line-height: 1.25;
}


h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
}


h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
}


h3 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
}


p {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
}


/* ==============================
   ACCESSIBLE FOCUS
   ============================== */

a:focus-visible,
button:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible,
textarea:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #f59e0b;
    outline-offset: 3px;
}


/* ==============================
   HEADER
   ============================== */

.site-header {
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);

    background-color: var(--dark-navy);
    color: var(--white);
}


.site-header h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--white);
}


.nav-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;

    gap: var(--space-2);

    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;

    list-style: none;
}


.nav-list a {
    display: inline-block;

    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2);

    border-radius: 6px;

    color: var(--white);
    text-decoration: none;
}


.nav-list a:hover {
    background-color: var(--blue);
}


/* ==============================
   SECTIONS
   ============================== */

#home,
#teams,
#about {
    max-width: 1200px;

    margin: 0 auto;

    padding: var(--space-6) var(--space-4);
}


#home {
    background-color: var(--white);
}


/* ==============================
   CARD LAYOUT
   ============================== */

.card-container {
    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);

    gap: var(--space-3);

    margin-top: var(--space-3);
}


.card {
    padding: var(--space-3);

    background-color: var(--white);

    border: 1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius: 12px;

    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(11, 37, 69, 0.10);
}


.card h3 {
    color: var(--dark-navy);
}


.card p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
}


/* ==============================
   CONTACT FORM
   ============================== */

.contact-form {
    max-width: 700px;

    margin-top: var(--space-4);

    padding: var(--space-4);

    background-color: var(--white);

    border: 1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius: 12px;

    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(11, 37, 69, 0.10);
}


.form-group {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
}


.form-group label {
    display: block;

    margin-bottom: var(--space-1);

    color: var(--dark-navy);

    font-weight: 600;
}


.form-group input,
.form-group textarea {
    width: 100%;

    min-height: 44px;

    padding: var(--space-1);

    border: 2px solid var(--border);

    border-radius: 6px;

    background-color: var(--white);

    color: var(--text);

    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
}


.form-group textarea {
    min-height: 140px;

    resize: vertical;
}


/* Error state */

.form-group input[aria-invalid="true"],
.form-group textarea[aria-invalid="true"] {
    border-color: var(--error);
}


.error-message {
    color: var(--error);

    font-weight: 600;
}


.required {
    color: var(--error);
}


/* ==============================
   FIELDSET
   ============================== */

fieldset {
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-3);

    padding: var(--space-3);

    border: 2px solid var(--border);

    border-radius: 8px;
}


legend {
    padding: 0 var(--space-1);

    color: var(--dark-navy);

    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
    font-weight: 700;
}


.radio-option {
    display: flex;

    align-items: center;

    gap: var(--space-1);

    margin-top: var(--space-1);
}


.radio-option input {
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
}


/* ==============================
   BUTTON
   ============================== */

button {
    min-height: 44px;

    padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-3);

    border: 2px solid var(--dark-navy);

    border-radius: 6px;

    background-color: var(--dark-navy);

    color: var(--white);

    font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;

    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;

    cursor: pointer;
}


button:hover {
    background-color: var(--blue);
}


/* ==============================
   FOOTER
   ============================== */

.site-footer {
    padding: var(--space-4);

    background-color: var(--dark-navy);

    color: var(--white);

    text-align: center;
}


.site-footer p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
}


/* ==============================
   TABLET - 768px
   ============================== */

@media (max-width: 768px) {

    #home,
    #teams,
    #about {
        padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-3);
    }


    .card-container {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);

        gap: var(--space-2);
    }


    .site-header {
        padding: var(--space-3);
    }
}


/* ==============================
   MOBILE - 480px
   ============================== */

@media (max-width: 480px) {

    h1 {
        font-size: 1.75rem;
    }


    h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }


    #home,
    #teams,
    #about {
        padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-2);
    }


    .card-container {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }


    .contact-form {
        padding: var(--space-2);
    }


    .nav-list {
        flex-direction: column;

        gap: var(--space-1);
    }
}
```

### README section

```markdown
# Sports Central

## Accessibility

### WAVE Fixes

- Added `lang="en"` to the HTML document.
- Added descriptive page titles.
- Added semantic `<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, and `<footer>` elements.
- Added an accessible navigation label with `aria-label`.
- Added `aria-current="page"` to identify the current page.
- Added proper `<label>` elements for all contact form fields.
- Added `fieldset` and `legend` to group related radio buttons.
- Added `required` and `aria-required` to required form fields.
- Added an accessible error message using `role="alert"`.
- Added visible keyboard focus indicators.
- Used a responsive layout so content remains usable on small screens.

## Color Contrast

The website uses a consistent navy, blue, white, and gray color palette.

Dark navy is used for headings, navigation, buttons, and other important elements so that text remains readable against light backgrounds.

Error messages use a dark red color against a light or white background.

The final colors should be verified with the WebAIM Contrast Checker before submission.

## Gestalt Principles

### Proximity

I used proximity to group related sports and team information together inside individual cards.

### Similarity

I used similarity by giving the sports and team cards consistent padding, borders, backgrounds, rounded corners, and typography.

## Visual Design

The website uses a consistent navy and blue color palette across all pages.

Montserrat is used for headings while Open Sans is used for body text.

The website uses an 8px spacing system for consistent margins, padding, and gaps.

CSS Grid is used for the multi-column card layout.

## Responsive Design

The website is designed for:

- 320px mobile
- 768px tablet
- 1200px desktop

Two CSS media queries are used to adjust the layout for tablet and mobile screens.

## Testing

The pages should be tested with WAVE for accessibility errors and warnings.

The pages should also be tested using browser DevTools device emulation at 320px, 768px, and 1200px.
```

This combined version covers the **Milestone 2 accessibility requirements, Gestalt principles, consistent palette, responsive layout, and accessible contact form** while keeping your original Sports Central content
